# Rust
target/
# llvm-cov profile droppings. The `coverage` mode removes these; this is the
# second line of defence, for a worker that is still writing one as the run
# finishes. They do not land in `target/` with the rest of the build output
# because the spawner hands the worker a fresh environment, so it never sees the
# `LLVM_PROFILE_FILE` cargo-llvm-cov sets.
default_*.profraw
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Go (prototype only)
*.test
prototype/**/dist/
prototype/wh-rotate/wh-rotate
prototype/whd/whd
prototype/whd/whctl
prototype/**/*.log

# local state and caches produced by any prototype run
prototype/**/wh-cache/
prototype/**/state/
prototype/**/wallpaper_downloads/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# agent worktrees, created inside this repo
.worktrees/

# editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
